{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"S1 CI Verified -1 root cause: emit_shadow_snapshot re-raised ConfigError/InsecureUrlError (a ConfigError subclass) from compose->resolve_with_sources, breaking 3 legacy ops that tolerate malformed/insecure config on their path (jira bridge setup --reset x2; completion gate off-with-warning). Fix: shadow is diagnostic-only and must NEVER raise -> removed the 'except ConfigError: raise' clause so ALL exceptions are swallowed+logged redacted. RED-first: added 3 emit_shadow tests (real malformed-toml ConfigError; monkeypatched InsecureUrlError; disabled) confirmed RED then GREEN. Full S1 oracle 38/38; make lint+typecheck clean. Unrelated local failure test_check_access_returns_a_typed_six_step_result is env-only (top-level rebar_reconciler not on venv path; fails with shadow OFF too; passes in-file and passed in CI). Amending Gerrit change 1841 + re-push."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787009744207932001,"uuid":"c7db46d0-dfbb-43ca-b4b3-8478bc75e437"}